  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c8d1a109e3f4550607082930a1a2b3c4, type: 3}
  m_Name: intro_world_chemistry
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MobileIdleBuilder::MobileIdleBuilder.DialogueSO
  lines:
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: 'You have crossed a threshold. Physics forged the elements one nucleus
      at a time. Out here they come as nature leaves them: hydrogen and oxygen as
      gases, carbon as graphite, nitrogen in the air.'
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    pauseGame: 1
    highlightTarget: 
    action: 
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: Research the Chemistry Lab, then put Extractors on the Hydrogen Seeps and
      Oxygen Vents and burn the two gases into water in a Molecular Synthesizer.
      Graphite and nitrogen come with later research. Travel between worlds from
      the Worlds panel whenever you wish; each keeps producing while you are away.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    pauseGame: 0
    highlightTarget: 
    action: 
